    "rating": 4.5,
    "reference": "ChIJbzgrzFg3yUwRimQB0-p6YOs",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Sidharsha Seebun",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109086680342864597326/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXKudMG0kFakl7nK6gjawj6Hb-k7_9RADyXsjarGDDvJkcojgTM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Very disappointed service with the after sale team. We bought our car (pre-owned) in February this year. We trusted their inspection, only to realize that the dashboard for the backseats was broken. I would have believed that it could have happened after but we only have babies in the back seat and it would surprise me that the bay would get off his car seat and do that. They said that they can’t cover it since it’s only aesthetics and that the AC is still working and if we wanted to have it fixed, we would need to pay money out of our pocket, despite us paying for extended warranty (apparently it doesn’t fall under extended warranty). Then once in April (spring), when snow is melting, it happened that when we opened the trunk, water seeped through and went inside the car. We thought that it was just us. In October, after the heavy rain fall (constant rain for a few days), when we opened our trunk, the back got soaked. We were told that it could be that one of the drainage is blocked. They charged us $400 for it. Upon talking to the after sale team, they still didn’t want to do anything about it, saying that it could have happened after we got the car. As we all know, the blockage is caused by build up over time. So I don’t see how few months of having the car could do that. We are unfortunately going to take actions against them because it’s unfair that they just sell you cars, with us trusting their inspection, only to deal with problems after and them not willing to do anything about it. If you are planning to buy a pre-owned vehicle from them, please reconsider. I forgot to mention that their inspection didn’t show a big scratch on the door initially, which we found when we went to pick up the car and which they had to fix. The manager had the audacity to bring up the fact that he got our door fixed (when they do have to have the door fixed or compensate for it since the car is still sitting in their compound). They are just money minded, not caring about anything else, specially the after sale manager. He said that unfortunately he will not be able to justify that expense to his superiors since it’s not their fault. We were willing to even pay half half but he refused. So please reconsider your thoughts if ever you like a pre owned vehicle there",
        "time": 1761849109,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jason J. Pasiolan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112096638690512824613/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocINLuhk8T48yOs_No_rVukcn5mIvHSaOTnnGRkf0Vee9B-tsmA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Great experience at Vaudreuil honda dealership! Super friendly staff, no pressure, and the process was quick and easy. Love my new car. Justin provided us with the information we needed for a car and ended up pulling the trigger. I would definitely recommend checking them out.",
        "time": 1755385250,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "William Avgoulas",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116841637630773058995/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzZAnDJAk1eWbEgrMNhNPLwZF1EaJ7_40i8FcBfZQmGE3SDw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I recently bought a 2021 Honda Civic from Marc, and the experience was excellent from start to finish. Marc was incredibly friendly, helpful, and professional throughout the entire process. Although the car was used, it had a couple of very minor cosmetic issues, and Marc made sure they were taken care of before I drove off the lot. He made the whole process smooth and stress-free. I really appreciated his honesty and attention to detail. I highly recommend working with Marc if you're looking for a vehicle — you’ll be in great hands! - Ernst was funny too :)",
        "time": 1754749923,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nuan Hu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114576457442738268295/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLsgMXJmvYLF2N--SbKchP001HYXuoKyphoMBsI7uEgnuYyoQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "This time last year, we were impressed by Justin’s professionalism when we first came to explore minivan options. Although we ultimately didn’t make a purchase then—despite taking up quite a bit of his time—Justin remained incredibly patient and helpful. A year later, he welcomed us back with the same enthusiasm and expertise. Thanks to his dedication, we were able to quickly secure our 2025 Audi and trade in our old car at a great value. Justin's warmth and commitment made the entire experience feel like working with family. Highly recommended—well done, Justin!",
        "time": 1753803464,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jay Bee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104527992789117609800/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV6jnE2qCF-zZC3v4Ju3LCIQC8TzukcJRVbKrmEWqmfcavgKgf3Gg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had gone to another dealer first because they had the \"black edition\" that I wanted, but it had some damage, so I passed on that one and went to Vaudreuil Honda to see a lower mileage CRV (not a black edition though). I was greeted by Justin and he made the experience extremely pleasant. I bought the CRV from Justin and I couldn't be happier!",
